{"3680420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Green Ember: Helmer in the Dragon Tomb", "steam_appid": 3680420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3-6 hour <strong>action adventure game</strong> (written by S.D. Smith), you play as the young rabbit, Helmer. Determined to reclaim his family farm, Helmer must  <strong>fight</strong> his way out of <strong>the Dragon Tomb</strong>. Backed by over 2,600 Kickstarter supporters, this first-ever Green Ember game brings the world to life for fans old and new.<br><br>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Combat</strong><br>Stay out of sight of patrolling guards or face them head-on. Use your <strong>fists to pummel</strong>, your <strong>sword to slash</strong>, or the <strong>environment to bonk enemies</strong> over the noggin'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemies</strong><br>Battle swarms of <strong>bats</strong>, fearsome <strong>Nightwalkers</strong>, powerful <strong>bosses</strong>, and uncover a <strong>mysterious force pulling strings behind the scenes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong><br>Navigate a dangerous underground dungeon full of brain-teasing challenges. <strong>Move boxes, pull levers, leap across collapsing platforms</strong>, and ride <strong>ore buckets</strong> through an ancient pulley system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and Secrets</strong><br><strong>Crack open treasure chests</strong> hidden deep in the dungeon to find <strong>valuable loot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue and Progression</strong><br><strong>Save prisoners</strong>, <strong>evade or defeat enemies</strong>, and <strong>respawn at save points</strong> when you're overwhelmed. Every scar moves you nearer to legendary status and every step brings you closer to the farm you love. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/ce58c70cbd2f8cabc94e72e3a7a902de.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/ce58c70cbd2f8cabc94e72e3a7a902de.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/95e3a50ea9a25323256bd646f18ea516.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/95e3a50ea9a25323256bd646f18ea516.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/0227df5b04763993b84912ad23607bb9.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/0227df5b04763993b84912ad23607bb9.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/cd561a5e247036507384452c249e2d36.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/cd561a5e247036507384452c249e2d36.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Download this thrilling adventure set deep in the world of the best-selling <i>Green Ember</i> series!  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3-6 hour <strong>action adventure game</strong> (written by S.D. Smith), you play as the young rabbit, Helmer. Determined to reclaim his 